	\subsection{Paramagnetic Phase}\label{parahydro}

	The symmetries of the XXZ spin Hamiltonian imply that the energy density$~\epsilon(x,t)$ and the $z$-component of magnetization density$~m_z(x,t)$ satisfy the following conservation equations
